OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785518371
OL,3,CMother and boyfriend jailed for life
OL,4,Cfor murdering her two-year-old daughter
OL,6,FA Teesside mother and her boyfriend
OL,7,Fhave both been jailed for life for
OL,8,Fmurdering her two-year-old daughter.
OL,10,FIsabelle Welsh suffered from weeks of
OL,11,Fabuse, including sustaining 21 broken
OL,12,Fbones, before she collapsed at her
OL,13,Fhome in Thornaby in September 2025.
OL,15,FShe died in hospital the following day.
OL,17,FOn Tuesday (28 July), Alexandra
OL,18,FWalker, 26, and Harrison Simpson, 22,
OL,19,Fwere convicted of murder and child
OL,20,Fcruelty following a trial at Teesside
OL,21,FCrown Court.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/3
