OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785518371
OL,3,CMother and boyfriend jailed for life
OL,4,Cfor murdering her two-year-old daughter
OL,6,FHe was also convicted of sexually
OL,7,Fassaulting Isabelle while her mother
OL,8,Fwas cleared of that charge.
OL,10,FOn Thursday (30 July) at the same
OL,11,Fcourt, the pair were both jailed for
OL,12,Flife, with Walker given a minimum term
OL,13,Fof 22 years, and Simpson a minimum
OL,14,Fterm of 28 years and six months, both
OL,15,Fminus time spent on remand.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/3
