CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785518371
OL,3,CMother and boyfriend jailed for life
OL,4,Cfor murdering her two-year-old daughter
OL,6,FAfter the pair were convicted,
OL,7,FDetective Chief Inspector Steve
OL,8,FChatterton of Cleveland Police, said:
OL,9,F"Isabelle suffered catastrophic
OL,10,Finjuries at the hands of the very
OL,11,Fpeople who should have loved her,
OL,12,Fcared for her and protected her.
OL,14,F"Her life was cruelly taken in the
OL,15,Fmost tragic and heartbreaking
OL,16,Fcircumstances."
